    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/nfdi4cat/goldbook-skos/blame/main/vocabularies/goldbook/IDs00xxx/00241.ttl> ;
    skos:definition "A phenomenon whereby the conformation of an enzyme or other protein is altered by combination, at a site other than the substrate-binding site, with a small molecule, referred to as an effector, which results in either increased or decreased activity by the enzyme."@en ;
